keywords:
  - research assessment
  - responsible metrics
  - CoARA
  - DORA
  - ORCID
  - academic careers
  - R
abstract: >-
  An R package that describes how a research career develops over time
  across research outputs, software, data, funding, positions, supervision,
  teaching, service, knowledge transfer, policy and open science, from
  ORCID, OpenAlex and DataCite and evidence declared by the researcher,
  without ranking or scoring people.
